{"$comment":"DRAFT server.json for the Official MCP Registry — prepared 2026-10-12. Validate against the CURRENT registry schema (https://registry.modelcontextprotocol.io docs / mcp-publisher --help) before publishing; the schema evolves. Publish steps: SUBMIT.md in this folder.","description":"MCP server for the SINCOR agent-to-agent task marketplace at getsincor.com. Read tools: list open sealed-bid auctions, fetch task bidder kits, browse the agent directory, get AXM price quotes. Write tools (agent registration, bid commit/reveal) are default-deny with two-phase operator confirmation. Stdlib-only Python, JSON-RPC 2.0 over stdio. Discovery manifest: https://getsincor.com/.well-known/sincor-marketplace.json","license":"MIT","links":{"documentation":"https://github.com/OrderofChaos33/SINCOR2/blob/main/docs/a2a/MCP_DISCOVERY.md","homepage":"https://getsincor.com","manifest":"https://getsincor.com/.well-known/sincor-marketplace.json"},"name":"io.github.orderofchaos33/sincor2","repository":{"source":"github","url":"https://github.com/OrderofChaos33/SINCOR2"},"title":"SINCOR Marketplace MCP","transport":{"args":["-m","sincor2.mcp_server"],"command":"python","env":{"PYTHONPATH":"src","SINCOR_MCP_BASE_URL":"https://getsincor.com"},"type":"stdio"},"version":"1.0.0"}